type: software

title: "USGS Stage Peaks"

authors:
  - family-names: "Buitrago"
    given-names: "Gonzalo"

abstract: >-
  Gap-aware USGS water-stage peak detection and statistical
  flood threshold estimation. The package supports recursive
  filtering, peak candidate ranking, and optional comparison
  with NOAA/NWS Action Stage.

version: 0.2.0

repository-code: "https://github.com/GonzaloAlbertoForeroBuitrago/usgs-stage-peaks"

license: Apache-2.0

keywords:
